      ],
      "source": "https://www.okhistory.org/publications/enc/entry?entry=GE001"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The historic Gillespie Building in Geary is listed on the National Register of Historic Places and houses the Canadian Rivers Historical Museum.",
